<title>BELGIUM: EU to review beet sugar processor contracts.</title>
<headline>EU to review beet sugar processor contracts.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Contract arrangments between sugar processors and beet producers are to be reviewed by the European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday, an EU official said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The European Commission was asked by ministers in 1995 to look at the so called inter-professional agreements (contracts) between producers and growers,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>No decision is expected, a trade source told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;No decision is anticipated. The Council asked for a review and the Commission is simply complying with that request,&quot; the trade source said.</p>
</text>
